    "level": "Preliminary",
    "design": "Cross-sectional, within-player comparison",
    "sample": "22 elite male volleyball players, Iran",
    "limitations": [
      "Only 22 young men, so small gaps could be missed",
      "Compared each player's two knees, not injured vs healthy players",
      "Standing X-rays only, no jump or landing data"
