      { "label": "Measured", "value": "7 angles, standing X-rays" }
    ],
    "bullets": [
      "Found elite club players in Iran with jumper's knee in one knee, using a hands-on tendon test.",
      "X-rayed both legs, hip to ankle, standing, with the feet in a set position.",
      "One examiner measured 7 alignment angles without knowing which knee hurt.",
      "Then compared the sore knee to the healthy one in the same player."
